024700* ---------------------------------------------------------------*
024800 2510-EDIT-CLAIM-2.
024900     IF CLM-REGION-CD NOT = 'UK' AND CLM-REGION-CD NOT = 'NO' AND
025000         CLM-REGION-CD NOT = 'SE' AND CLM-REGION-CD NOT = 'DK'
